{"seq":6,"slug":"serverless-architecture","title":"无服务器架构","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.13,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":2}},"introMarkdown":"# 无服务器架构 简介\n\n无服务器架构代表了云计算的进一步抽象，开发者无需管理底层服务器即可运行代码，平台自动处理资源分配、弹性伸缩和高可用。这种架构模式极大降低了运维负担，使团队能够更专注于业务逻辑的开发与迭代。\n\n本手册面向有云平台开发经验的工程师，系统介绍无服务器计算的核心概念、主流平台、设计模式和运维实践。读者将学会如何在合适的场景中采用 Serverless 架构，并有效管理其生产环境中的挑战。\n\n全书共分为四章，从概念认知到生产实践完整覆盖：\n\n第一章**Serverless 概念**建立对无服务器计算的基础认知，分析冷启动等关键技术挑战与优化策略，并对比 Serverless 与容器化方案的适用场景。\n\n第二章**FaaS 平台**以 AWS Lambda 为核心深入讲解函数即服务的实践方法，对比各大云平台的函数计算服务，并介绍边缘函数在全球部署中的应用。\n\n第三章**无服务器模式**总结事件驱动架构、无服务器 API 设计和工作流编排等核心设计模式，帮助读者在实际项目中做出合理的架构决策。\n\n第四章**运维实践**聚焦无服务器应用的生产运维，包括监控与调试方法、安全权限管理以及成本优化与容量规划策略。\n\n建议读者先理解 Serverless 的基本理念和适用边界，再通过具体平台的实操掌握开发技巧，最后关注生产环境的运维与成本管理。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serverless-concepts","title":"Serverless 概念","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serverless-overview","title":"Serverless 架构概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-concepts/serverless-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-start","title":"冷启动问题与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-concepts/cold-start"},{"seq":3,"slug":"serverless-vs-containers","title":"Serverless 与容器化对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-concepts/serverless-vs-containers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"faas-platforms","title":"FaaS 平台","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aws-lambda","title":"AWS Lambda 深入实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/aws-lambda"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-functions","title":"Google Cloud Functions 与 Cloud Run","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/cloud-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-functions","title":"边缘函数与 Edge Computing","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/faas-platforms/edge-functions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"serverless-patterns","title":"无服务器模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-driven-patterns","title":"事件驱动架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-patterns/event-driven-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serverless-api","title":"Serverless API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-patterns/serverless-api"},{"seq":3,"slug":"workflow-orchestration","title":"工作流编排与 Step Functions","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-patterns/workflow-orchestration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"serverless-operations","title":"运维实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serverless-monitoring","title":"Serverless 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-monitoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serverless-security","title":"Serverless 安全实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-security"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization","title":"Serverless 成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/cost-optimization"}]}]}